# [CompliRules] CCPA/CPRA 11 CCR § 7025 Automated Global Privacy Control (GPC) Opt-Out Mandate
**Severity:** `HIGH` | **Jurisdiction:** `CCPA_US`

## Legal Citations
- **California Code of Regulations, Title 11 (§ 7025 (opt-out preference signals))**: `Sec-GPC: 1` başlığı veya `navigator.globalPrivacyControl` sinyali kişisel verinin satışı/paylaşımı için bağlayıcı opt-out talebidir. Oturum açmış kullanıcıda sinyal kullanıcının profiline işlenir; hesap tercihiyle çelişirse işletme ancak kullanıcıyı bilgilendirip onayını alarak devam edebilir. *[Sanction: California AG v. Sephora (2022): 1,2 milyon $; DoorDash (2024): 375.000 $.]*
- **Colorado Privacy Act (4 CCR 904-3, Rule 5.11)**: Colorado da evrensel opt-out mekanizmalarını tanımayı zorunlu kılar.

## Rule Mandates
- MUST: Inspect incoming HTTP request headers for `Sec-GPC: 1` and client-side `navigator.globalPrivacyControl === true`.
- MUST: When the GPC signal is active, automatically treat it as a binding opt-out of personal data sale and sharing under CCPA/CPRA § 7025.
- MUST: Disable third-party advertising cookies, retargeting scripts, and data broker sync pipelines immediately upon detecting GPC.
- MUST: For authenticated users, persist the `ccpaOptedOut: true` preference to their database profile to ensure cross-device compliance.

## Forbidden Anti-Patterns
- NEVER: Ignoring or overriding the browser Sec-GPC: 1 header or navigator.globalPrivacyControl signal
- NEVER: Requiring consumers who broadcast GPC signals to manually navigate preference toggles or submit written forms
- NEVER: Loading retargeting ad trackers when evaluateGpcSignal() returns optOutActive: true

## Reference Compliant Code Snippets
### Sunucu Tarafı GPC Değerlendirmesi (Next.js Middleware)
```ts
import { evaluateGpcSignal, applyGpcToPreferences, CookieConsentManager } from '@complirules/primitives';

export function middleware(req: Request) {
  const gpc = evaluateGpcSignal(req.headers, { isAuthenticated: Boolean(getSession(req)) });
  const prefs = applyGpcToPreferences(readPreferences(req) ?? CookieConsentManager.createDefaultPreferences(), gpc);

  if (gpc.shouldPersistToProfile) {
    void saveProfile(getSession(req)!.userId, { ccpaOptedOut: true });
  }
  if (!CookieConsentManager.isCategoryAllowed(prefs, 'marketing')) {
    // Reklam piksellerini yükleme
  }
}
```
